## ProjectParser

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Dotnet.Options`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Dotnet`

### Purpose
Parses .csproj files to extract SDK type, root namespace, target frameworks, NuGet packages, and framework references.

### Static Methods

```csharp
public static ProjectFileInfo ParseProject(string csprojPath);
public static bool IsSdkStyleProject(string csprojPath);
public static string GetRootNamespace(string csprojPath);
public static string GetTargetFrameworks(string csprojPath);
public static List<NuGetPackage> GetNuGetPackages(string csprojPath);
public static List<string> GetFrameworkReferences(string csprojPath);
```

### ProjectFileInfo

```csharp
public class ProjectFileInfo
{
    public string FilePath { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string FileName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public bool IsSdkStyle { get; set; }
    public string? SdkType { get; set; }
    public string RootNamespace { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public bool IsRootNamespaceExplicit { get; set; }
    public string TargetFrameworks { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public List<NuGetPackage> NuGetPackages { get; set; } = new();
    public List<string> FrameworkReferences { get; set; } = new();
}
```

### NuGetPackage

```csharp
public class NuGetPackage
{
    public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Version { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public override string ToString() => string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Version) ? Name : $"{Name} {Version}";
}
```

### Parsing Behavior
- Uses `System.Xml.Linq.XDocument`
- Detects SDK-style by presence of `Sdk` attribute on root
- Root namespace: explicit from `RootNamespace` element, or inferred from file name
- Target frameworks: checks `TargetFrameworks` (plural), `TargetFramework` (singular), `TargetFrameworkVersion` (legacy)
- NuGet packages: extracts `PackageReference` elements (attribute or child element for version)
- Framework references: extracts `FrameworkReference` elements
